  "value": {
   "primary": "Accelerate and protect a three-mana commander and attack with Nathan every turn. Each attack exiles the top card of every library and lets you cast one of them; trigger multipliers and extra combats (Roaming Throne, Firebender Ascension, Karlach, Fire Lord Azula) turn that into a repeatable heist.",
   "secondary": "A theft suite (Gonti, Thief of Sanity, Tinybones, Hostage Taker, Opposition Agent, Notion Thief, Laughing Jasper Flint) turns stolen resources into card advantage; payoffs like Don Andres and Nalfeshnee monetize casting cards you don't own."
  },
